# Third-party Bases plugin (MIT) used by tests/e2e/bases-plugin-view.spec.ts as
# the real-world check that a Bases view registers and renders. Its shipped
# bundle is checked in so the test exercises the actual published artifact
# rather than a hand-written stand-in. Disabled by default, like status-probe.
!test-vault/.geode/plugins/kanban-bases-view/
# The Ivory theme ships with the demo vault so it's installed and selectable
# out of the box in Settings -> Appearance -> Themes. Other themes dropped
# into test-vault/.geode/themes/ locally stay ignored.
!test-vault/.geode/themes/
